DESCRIPTION: Every month, the tech committee meets to discuss on-going work and priorities. The objective for each meeting is for each member to come away with at least 1 deliverable they can work towards for the next meeting.This is also a good time to network, plan future projects, and discuss the role of technology in the greater socialist movement.**NOTE:** Meeting will be held at 8PM virtually in OmahaDSA Signal. Send message in Discord to join if you haven't done so already. \n ID:a291f9b6-73c2-4192-a7a1-178d17785feb \n LINK:https://actionnetwork.org/events/monthly-omaha-dsa-tech-committee-meeting-5
